{artist: BSP}
{title: Země vzdálená}

{start_of_tab}
e ---------------------------3----5-3--------------------
H ------------------------------3------------------------
G 0---0---0-2---2-0-2--0----------------0-----0-2---0----
D ------0----------------2------------------0---------4-2
